  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven: 1604 × 4 – 525 ÷ 5 + 73 = ?\n\nAccording to the question, after ‘+’ and ‘–‘ are interchanged and ‘x’ and ‘÷’ are interchanged:\n\n1604 × 4 – 525 ÷ 5 + 73 = ? ⇒ 1604 ÷ 4 + 525 × 5 – 73 = ?\n\n⇒ __**1604 **____**÷**____** 4**__ + 525 × 5 – 73 = ?\n\n⇒ 401 + __**525 **____**×**____** 5**__ – 73 = ?\n\n⇒ __401____ + 2625__ – 73 = ?\n\n⇒ __3026____ –____ 73__ = ?\n\n⇒ 2953 = ?\n\nHence, \"Option 3\" is the correct answer.",
